akes and figure out how to move forward, Saki realizes she's less and less sure how to feel about Yuta.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eO7C7Kf7SZiigX1CylJjClo0PMT.jpg"},{"title":"Tendencies and Strategies","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17529","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"152681","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"52481","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"206629","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"422721","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"83423","synopsis":"A month has passed since Yuta and Saki started living together. As Yuta starts to understand the ambiguity of their relationship, Saki asks him for help studying modern literature. The two work together to prepare Saki for a test retake.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t1zCEOt0UGBIzmKxJ0BSDqVloRL.jpg"},{"title":"A Late Show and the Real Deal","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17529","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"152681","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"52481","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"206629","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"422721","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"83616","synopsis":"Shiori invites Yuta to a late showing of a movie adaptation of a book she enjoys. Saki takes an interest and goes to the bookstore the next day, where she meets Shiori for the first time.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kaYtOzfkFi3Qw2uaIyLpN5NG61x.jpg"},{"title":"Sweet & Sour Pork and Rain","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17529","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"152681","e