ko for advice. Akiko tells him that he should take Saki out for a break now and then, even if he has to insist. Later, when Yuta tries to talk to Saki about the pool trip with Maaya, Saki reacts harshly.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4ny13wwyW1S9fPS7dpy9KFldDQz.jpg"},{"title":"Stepsister and Diary","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17529","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"152681","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"52481","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"206629","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"422721","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"84786","synopsis":"Yuta and Saki accept Maaya's invitation to go to the pool with a group of friends. Saki enjoys the time at one of her favorite places and is finally able to let loose a little. Then, on the way home, Saki blurts something out that leaves Yuta speechless. (Subs Flix_)","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tExdpWLobUwx5Yd3NXQ3zklObdj.jpg"},{"title":"Relations and Regrets","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17529","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"152681","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"52481","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"206629","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"422721","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"84971","synopsis":"A new school term has started, and parent-teacher meetings are on the horizon. At school, Yuta and Saki still have not told anyone that they are siblings. As their mother, Akiko wants to attend both meetings, but she worries it would expose their secret.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5NnibpjT5GHp1SHYl6H3ZSUqrKL.jpg"},{"title":"Brother and Sister","